{"c":{"125946":["Kotoko Iwanaga","Female","b125946-YAjl4xufsVYn.png","Kotoko is the main female protagonist in Kyokou Suiri and the current girlfriend of Kuro Sakuragawa. She has a very outgoing personality and always makes an effort to find the root of any problem, especially when she has the help of yokai.",1450],"125947":["Kurou Sakuragawa","Male","b125947-i00TGOORpPyt.png","Kuro is the main male protagonist of Kyokou Suiri (In/Spectre) and the current boyfriend of Kotoko Iwanaga. He has supernatural powers of immortality and precognition. Kuro is quiet and tends to be very nonconfrontational, barely even taking notice of his own injuries.",320],"148748":["Tokunosuke Terada",null,"b148748-f4rXH72ZESE3.jpg","",5],"148749":["Saki Yumihara",null,"b148749-1C6yejsYXWf1.png","Saki is Kurou Sakuragawa's former girlfriend. She works as a traffic division officer at the local police department. She is a mature young woman who likes to think things through rationally but is easily scared by yokai.",2167],"148750":["Karin Nanase","Female","b148750-5PGsc2fHJyIC.jpg","",68],"151967":["Rikka Sakuragawa","Female","b151967-fWEk9L8ouPHc.png","Rikka is Kurou Sakuragawa's older cousin and the reason he visited the hospital as regularly as he did. Just like Kuro, she also has the powers of immortality and precognition, although she wants them to be removed and has tried medical science and suicide to no avail.",86],"169785":["Aoi Tanio",null,"b169785-S4WfiqxEFqcB.png","Aoi Tanio is a woman convicted of murder and the reason that Guardian Serpent of Tsukana Swamp requested the help of Kotoko Iwanaga in Chapter 15 of the Manga and Episode 2 of the Anime. She is the main suspect of a murder for disposing a dead body into the Tsukuna Swamp.",8],"221387":["Kamogawa no Kappa",null,"b221387-g5kGLdBr45SP.png","",1],"221388":["Ochimusha",null,"b221388-QKE6k4Tn54XR.png","",1],"221389":["Kintama no Genichirou",null,"b221389-mlDXQBwB8Y36.png","",2],"266166":["Masayuki Muroi","Male","b266166-XA4bge2qBem8.png","Because of facing many betrayals from his beloved people, he loses faith in human beings and wants to have an isolated life.",22],"266167":["Yuki-onna","Female","b266167-ARBvuHChSJ3y.jpg","She has an appearance of a very beautiful woman with a smooth, white complexion, fitting her Snowy profile. She has long hair with a mix color of black and white. She often wears a white kimono. She really cares about Masayuki Muroi, who she thinks is too kind for a human.",260],"298641":["Yuurei","Male","b298641-R724A4NNaU0e.png","",1],"298642":["Youkai","Male","b298642-hSNEqENsrijj.png","",1],"298643":["Bakemono","Male","b298643-vargfLhb1OoJ.png","",2],"298644":["Shiro Komainu",null,"b298644-xMLoWaR8Ufgb.png","",2],"298646":["Kuro Komainu",null,"b298646-3PSM6lkOXlEk.png","",2],"298647":["Rikishi no Ayakashi","Male","b298647-WGNCUK7Q66KG.png","",0],"298648":["Kanrinin","Male","b298648-O1gaU0q44UB3.png","",0],"298654":["Furukawa Keiji","Male","b298654-onVZ2GBMagTu.png","",0],"298655":["Nagisa Iizuka","Female","b298655-fQt6KrKJ1cEx.png","A former co-worker under Masayuki.",0],"298656":["Hayato Yamazaki","Male","b298656-1zodR9Acbx2O.png","",0],"298657":["Keikan","Male","b298657-vnwdanXWJTfD.png","",0],"298658":["Keiji","Male","b298658-V6wfgKqKUWW2.png","",0],"298659":["Bengoshi","Male","b298659-MaS3VA4pmURS.png","",0],"298661":["Honda Keiji","Male","b298661-YovcSkHmmFXu.png","",0],"298662":["Miharu Harada","Female","b298662-SXNCO2ze9rpj.png","",0],"298663":["Ayakashi",null,"b298663-bDkiR4UPSOw0.png","",0],"298665":["Kazuyuki Konno","Male","b298665-yusD7RjcbBqp.png","Manager of the apartment Rikka moves into.",0],"298666":["Marumi Oki","Female","b298666-DswM8IU319nu.png","Kazuyuki's girlfriend.",3],"298667":["Announcer",null,"default.jpg","",0],"298668":["Manzai-shi 1",null,"default.jpg","",0],"298670":["Manzai-shi 2",null,"default.jpg","",0],"298672":["Tae Shimai","Female","b298672-KY1dbKjwDzec.png","An old woman who lives with a ghost cat in a small port town. Altho